	(text "D-013: window 21.6-26.0 V; nothing downstream above 26.45 V steady. Worst-case stacks (corners of every term):\nOV cut-off = LM2903B-1 vs REF5025E: ref 2.5 V +/-0.066 % (0.025 % + 2.5 ppm/K x 165 K), VIO +/-4 mV, IB 50 nA,\n16.9k/1.78k 0.1 % + 10 ppm/K x 65 K each, 1M hysteresis to VOL 0-0.55 V -> 26.131-26.417 V -> OV_CUT -> OVP of all\n8 eFuses (8.5-14 us). PG_24V = high edge LM2903B-2 18.7k/2.00k 25.740-26.012 V AND low edge TPS3700 INA+\n(VIT- 387-400 mV) 100k/1.91k 20.58-21.41 V. Chain UV (sheet 08) 18.33-19.07 V. eFuse UVLO (TPS1663 1.176-1.224 /\n1.09-1.15 V, 100k/8.06k 0.1 %) 15.72-16.48 V on, 14.57-15.48 V off: +24V (CTRL) is the logic limit at a hand-over.\nTVS SMCJ33CA (VBR >= 36.7 V) stays idle in the design surge - see the surge reservoir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 354.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "072eac2a-7064-5f76-9af4-cbed8660ef33")
	)
	(text "BZX84-C12 rail from 24V_F3: works before any logic rail exists, so AUX-HV can start the module alone.\nEach TPS3700 OUTB pulls AUX_EN low (LM74800 shutdown, both FETs off) while its cabinet feed is healthy.\nOUTA (INA+ = VDET / 11) holds AUX_EN low while the detector itself is starting (SBVS187G 7.4.2, fig 22),\nso a hot-plugged AUX-HV can neither enable the LM74800 nor trip the inhibit before the decision is valid."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.446 163.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c1d5085-b2d9-5792-ab23-dc45104f601b")
	)
	(text "Fuse 30 A / 60 VDC; TVS 1500 W bidirectional (53 V clamp, blocks -33 V wiring error).\nLM74700 + CSD18532Q5B: ideal diode, ORs the feeds, blocks reverse current and polarity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 85.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2fb0ed28-a68b-5b3a-b2d0-213c2085603f")
	)
	(text "Fuse 30 A / 60 VDC; TVS 1500 W bidirectional (53 V clamp, blocks -33 V wiring error).\nLM74700 + CSD18532Q5B: ideal diode, ORs the feeds, blocks reverse current and polarity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.662 85.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33c0b2ce-c445-5e9f-8ffe-f150c4f799f8")
	)
