	)
	(text "2 x 1000 uF 50 V low-impedance electrolytic absorb the surge charge (check_surge, every build).\nDesign surge IEC 61000-4-5 0.5 kV / 12 ohm: I 41.7 A, Q 3.00 mC into 2 x 1000 uF (C_min 1.28 mF, ESR_max 32 mOhm)\n-> bus and every branch <= 30.07 V (TVS idle below 36.7 V; worst load margin 1.9 V, UCC14241 32 V).\n0.5 kV / 2 ohm line-to-line (EN IEC 61000-6-2 only for 24 V cables > 30 m) would reach 39 V: NOT covered -\nkeep the cabinet 24 V wiring < 30 m or fit an external SPD. The OV cut-off may open the eFuses for ~1.3 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.128 258.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e0e5c7d4-b3a9-536f-b394-31d2410fbb66")
	)
